{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18mini_level_act18mini_st02","groupId":"act18mini","stageId":null,"title":"到乌萨斯去","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18mini/level_act18mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"1b072d2c75d5a60273303cfbbfcd3c04e15fd99bc8440472f08a50c0112ca84f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"主编先生，这是关于切尔诺伯格的全部资料，我给您放在桌子上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您能从这些满是灰尘的东西里找到想要的信息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的整理，热尼亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"助理离开时习惯性地将门带上，老旧的门蹭过不平的地板，发出的声音堪比惨叫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐直身体，主编点起一根烟，忍住不适开始翻阅眼前堆成山的旧报纸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"《第三集团军在切尔诺伯格事件中的渎职......》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧......老调重弹的东西，《切尔诺伯格关闭的矿场——对乌萨斯源石工业的打击》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......《新切尔诺伯格——在陛下的光辉下，感染者的幸福生活》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"简直是无稽之谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，都不是我要找的......这些破烂不过是在最外面兜圈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主编","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没有一篇报道能够接近真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主编推高滑下的眼镜，弹了弹烟灰，却不慎将火星溅在纸上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他急忙扑灭燃起的火苗，可报纸已被灼烧出一个洞。\n透过小洞，主编看到一行小小的文字——“整合运动”。\n那是他从未见过的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天，陆续有感染者找到我们，表达了自己想要加入整合运动的意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉他们，一个月后，我们将离开伦蒂尼姆，去往高多汀公爵领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，他们也愿意和我们一同出走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"没有同意，也没有拒绝。他们自己没有答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会做好带他们离开的准备，他们已经没有其他地方可去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高多汀公爵领。听说那位公爵颁布了许多改善感染者生活条件的命令，的确需要观察一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"命令无法代表现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然清楚这一点，塔露拉。所以亲自去确认一下才更有价值。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"角落处，陈将手中的报纸翻过一页，发出轻微的哗啦声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈，你在旁边听了那么久，打算一直不说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你们内部的事情，九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些事轮不上我发表看法，我的注意力都在报纸上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你私下与队伍中许多人交流时的表态可并不是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要你的意见，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我放任你留在我们身边，并非只是为了向你证明这支队伍有多么不一样，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必自以为是地认为你对我和塔露拉负有责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的情况下，任何能帮上这些人的力量我都不会拒绝。你大可说明你的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是想接纳那些无处可去的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会成为我们新的有生力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者是新的矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这支被你们以所谓“整合运动”的名号聚拢的队伍，各种身份的人混杂其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九，这就是你当初离开时向我许下的愿景吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还加上她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈看向了淡然的塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们迟早会引来更多的目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你问我，我建议你们暂时停留在伦蒂尼姆一段时间，稍作休整——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后让更合适的人来处理这件事，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你们这支队伍中的人，罪犯、感染者、从战场逃离的军人......你真的知道自己要把他们带到什么地方去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少绝不是停留在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？这么着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动战士","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......九，雷德刚刚带回来一个紧急的消息。呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他瞥了一眼身边的陈。\n自从这个名为“陈”的陌生人来到他们的队伍，周围的同伴就都表现得很奇怪。\n她很少离开塔露拉和九的身边，也从不对整合运动的行动发表任何看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，她是自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动战士","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......工厂附近有一支公爵联军的部队正在靠近。需要让他们离开吗，九？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵联军？虽然他们应该不会特意针对我们......我亲自去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......带着大家隐蔽起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也认同九的做法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......并不完全同意。但这支队伍，和最初那支与我在雪原上同行的队伍很不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"遗憾的是，对待这些被压迫的人，这片大地上的任何地方都没有区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁，没人在乎这些人去哪里，他们只在乎我们最后停在哪里。然后思索，到底该如何驱逐我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"“整合运动”，这个名字意味着一个我亲手铸就的错误......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"九并不想抹去这个错误，但如果她必须要我给这个名字一个新的解释——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有拒绝的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她甚至也对这么做心安理得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"九......还有我，都很清楚自己在做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是你，晖洁，你一路追着我，或者说整合运动的踪迹走到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"为何还迟迟不做你早就决定好的事呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到塔露拉离开了陈的身边许久，陈也没有试图再跟上塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"联军士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"往前走，你们这些野兽，别停下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹平民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......*维多利亚粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"快点爬起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"看他们这副恶心的样子，真想在这里把他们解决掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，前面是典范军的势力范围，你想把垃圾倒在他们门口吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想多生事，既然垃圾处理站已经设立好了，就不要乱倒垃圾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹平民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"处理垃圾......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，我不想问你收到的军令是何时下达，来自何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里不是你行刑的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，躲在工厂里的那些感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你们该庆幸，我们如今忙着抓捕这些魔族佬，而不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空气逐渐升温，九用余光瞥向一处幽暗的角落。\n在黑暗中，火光亮起，随即又缓缓黯淡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你......刚刚有没有感觉到皮肤有一阵刺痛，就像、就像——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"就像被火灼烧一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们想动手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片厂区受典范军庇护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去问问你的上级，是否愿意手下出现一个蠢货，挑起与工厂的矛盾，毁了好不容易得来的和平？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，我想你就清楚该怎么说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果和我们在同一条战线的朋友，对我们共同的敌人展示出了不该有的同情和怜悯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"想必我的上级就是另一种态度了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"让开，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们的口音听上去可不像是卡兹戴尔来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族佬很会伪装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可不想放过任何一个试图伪装起来的魔族雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"气愤的联军士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧走，你们这些魔族佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹平民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"押送萨卡兹的队伍缓缓走过长街，可不论是俘虏还是军人，都是一副疲惫且麻木的神情。\n九目送他们离开，在垂着头的战俘群中，她看到几个少年踉跄地走在最后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混账......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这个地方了，先生，大火烧了三天三夜，几乎什么也没剩下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"除了纠察队的哨站，火势有波及矿场吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"没......但那里的矿工趁乱逃走了很多，大家都很害怕......不知道纠察队什么时候会来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"但您先来了，您说您只是记者，但谁说得准呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我对这些不感兴趣，这里的管理一向以强硬著称，矿工们的纵火计划是怎么实现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"矿工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是的，村子里有位从城市里来的贵族老爷，人很好......就是有些太善良了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"他见不得矿场里的事，总将解救矿工挂在嘴边，我们都以为只是说说，可谁知到头来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"他真去做了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦？那他现在在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是和纠察队的军官们一起在火灾中死去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，一位品格高尚的贵族，为帮助受苦的感染者矿工，不惜奉献自己的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听起来是个不错的选题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"记者的目光在焦黑的土地上打量，四周的建筑已经彻底沦为废墟，曾经茂密的树林也只剩下丑陋的树桩。\n突然，他的注意力被一处焦痕吸引，它古怪，却又带着几分美学色彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那您知道......这个标志是谁留下的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是个烧焦的痕迹罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是个痕迹我可交不了差，现在开始它就是个“标志”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这个“标志”到底是谁留下的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......不清楚，大火烧过后，它就在这里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，您是说，这是有人刻意为之，试图向外界传递一种信号——“拯救”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"当地村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"报社记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（笑）您不刚刚才为我讲述了关于它的事实吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必着急，排好队，每个人都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，我们还要在这里待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一批出城的队伍要等到什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你们在这里很安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经联系了很多不同的渠道送大家离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我听说、听说搜捕城内萨卡兹的士兵已经找到这里来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们发现了你们窝藏萨卡兹的事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"窝藏？你们怎么把自己说得像罪犯一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"身为伦蒂尼姆市民，你们也是这场战争的受害者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的军队还未入驻伦蒂尼姆前，我们就不受欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，那支队伍里面可不只有士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少当下，身为萨卡兹就是最恶劣的罪行，无论是否参与了战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之......谢谢你们的收留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和其他人已经商量好了，如果三天后还没等到出城的机会，我们会自行离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵们搜捕的范围和强度都远超以前，现在不是离开的好时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这正是我们要尽快离开的原因，每拖一天形势只会更恶劣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你们坚持离开，我会为你们提供援助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们的慷慨，我建议你们也尽早离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当他们处理干净城内的萨卡兹后，又会将矛头对准谁呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们大多是感染者，应该很清楚那些贵族老爷的态度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sanatorium_balcony"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，这是今天的报纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......阿廖沙，我懒得看了，上面有什么新的消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一些新的税收政策，一些新的文艺作品，一些新的绯闻轶事，还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一些暴乱，全国各地都有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于有些家伙愿意报道一些真正的新闻了，我以为圣骏堡的记者这辈子都只会抓花边新闻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“全国各地的工厂与哨站遭遇感染者罢工事件，个别地区冲突升级，感染者明目张胆袭击哨站与当地政府机构，造成严重损失......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“据称，这些感染者是受到一个名为‘整合运动’的感染者组织的鼓舞......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看，他们还留下了一些记号......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......您需要结束疗养吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然不，这可是好不容易得来的假期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但您在宣传部的同僚已经几次三番造访了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿廖申卡，我亲爱的阿廖申卡，我们的国家久抱痼疾，有很多人都想治愈她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但首先，那些陈朽的伤口需要被暴露出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我受够我的同僚们对它们的层层粉饰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我该怎么回复他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告诉他们什么事都等我的假期结束后再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们又从城内搜刮出了一批俘虏吗？塔露拉，你的汤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点淡吗？唉，这是我从盐罐里搜刮出的最后一点盐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，味道很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“搜刮”？我喜欢这个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"一周前他们不会从工厂前面经过，他们的战俘队伍中也没有孩子出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在我们都见到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这半个月里他们简直立志抹除掉所有萨卡兹留下的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"刚开始还只是未来得及撤离的士兵，随后是与军队有过交集的平民，最后连土生土长的伦蒂尼姆人也不放过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为你会动手，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那只会让事情变得更复杂。这里是维多利亚，我必须用更稳妥的办法解决问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这意味着花费更多的时间，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几天前我看到一群孩子在纠缠一位可怜的妇人......她不过是与萨卡兹结婚并养育了几个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争前他们这样对感染者，战争后就变成了萨卡兹。这迟早会波及每一个伦蒂尼姆的市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些受到不公待遇之人最缺的，就是时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"九顿了顿，看向一旁的塔露拉。\n但塔露拉显得异常平静，似乎方才在街上，九面对士兵时，感觉到温度的骤然升高只是一场幻觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你刚才真的想要对那些维多利亚人动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"只是警告，继续纠缠下去只会引来更大的麻烦。不到迫不得已，在伦蒂尼姆保持低调是明智的。这一点上晖洁的看法并非毫无道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"在工业区的街道上攻击公爵联军，对生活在这里的工人不是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你并不为此愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你所经历的，我早已经历过。但至少，萨卡兹的血脉不会像矿石病一样到处传染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我早已经学会控制愤怒，至少，我的愤怒不会留给这些对自己所作所为尚无认知的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战争把被压迫者迫害成了压迫者，错不在他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些无辜萨卡兹又该将他们的愤怒宣泄给谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得那个骑着摩托为我们找来物资的萨卡兹商人吗......感染者因为恐惧而杀死了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，这份恐惧正随着萨卡兹的逐渐败退迅速蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者、军人、贵族......甚至对战争毫无概念的普通人，呵，他们都在做自认正确的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对，塔露拉，萨卡兹的血脉不会像矿石病一样到处传染......但仇恨和恐惧会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你决定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救下那些萨卡兹？我不觉得这需要犹豫，他们和我们并无差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是无法保证能将影响控制在最小范围内，所以我需要你，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保护好营地里的人，还有那些工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你需要我的火为这些人燃烧，我不会犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷德，你去告诉那些工人我们马上要做的事，愿意加入我们的留下；害怕的，帮助他们离开，带他们去典范军的营地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以现在试着拦下我们所有人，也可以就此离开，当作什么事情都没有发生过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救下那些萨卡兹，意味着你们原本的计划要全部改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，带着他们，没有任何公爵领会容忍你们的停留，九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道现在他们就会容忍我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是感染者，陈，或许和罗德岛接触得太久了，让你对感染者的真实处境的记忆模糊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们接下来要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这意思是你默许我们行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是俘虏，也不该被这样草率地处决，他们甚至没有正式的军令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"问题并不在于九他们要去哪，而在于哪需要他们，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会找到一个真正属于我们的地方，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止感染者......还有所有被剥夺平等生存的权利的人、被奴役的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个不会存在歧视，也不会存在压迫的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这很难，难到几乎毫无可能，九，我们都很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然知道，陈。但这是一个我们都认识的人教会我的，他死了，但至少他为我们留下了些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"总得有人去做，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这支整合运动的队伍开发自己的药物，借助一切可能去为需要的人提供帮助，并非要索求一份肉眼可及的回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"一种变化正在催生，但它太过脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他们需要一个信念，一个目标。唯有这样，他们才能继续走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管我无法完全认同九的做法，但我也找不到拒绝去做的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁，九一直很欣赏你所追求的“公平”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那你为何不去看看她所追求的东西呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在皇帝的诏令都不屑提及的那片雪原里，反抗活动愈演愈烈，数千名感染者联结在一起，打破身上的枷锁，重获自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们做到了从前难以想象的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从那位匿名贵族点燃的第一把火开始，许多人在私下流传，是不是有人在领导我们？说实话，连我也不确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道，我们渴望反抗的呼声没有被缄默，它正试图冲出这片被树林掩盖的雪原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个人人都好奇的、独一无二的、火焰灼烧出的标志就是证明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"电台中沙哑的嗓音打破了平凡乡村的宁静。\n人们推开房门，或攀在窗沿，安静倾听。\n广播中的消息令他们兴奋，在零下几十度的天气中也觉得手心滚烫。\n随后，他们点亮村子中心的火把，火光照亮他们的眼睛，也温暖着他们单薄衣衫下的身体。\n很快，邻近的村子看到火光，相继点亮篝火。\n在黑暗的雪原上，无数火光点亮了夜空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们集结在这难以生存的冻原，沿着他们曾踏过的脚印，在这里扎根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们都听说过那支消失在切尔诺伯格、为感染者而战的队伍，“整合运动”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是他们听到了我们的呼唤吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匿名电台","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是他们回来了吗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g6_hotellobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你们这群渣滓，背过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......求、求您别杀我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在这里出生的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我和他们不是一伙的，求、求您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，闭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先、先生，不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，他才不管你是谁，他只是想杀掉自己面前所有的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年突然闻到了一股异香，令他想起母亲怀抱中的香水味。\n无数花朵在被血污沾满的地板上绽开，香味愈发浓郁。\n行刑的士兵忽然剧烈地咳嗽起来，直至吐出一朵朵带血的花苞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"带着其他人离开，我们的人会在外面接应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......不要......咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九，解除你的源石技艺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经救下那些萨卡兹了！杀死他们......太过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像往常一样保持沉默不好吗，陈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不想整合运动离开伦蒂尼姆后被公爵的军队四处追赶，就别再四处树敌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉能确保一切只会被解读为一场意外的火灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们只会将火灾全部归咎于萨卡兹的报复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后呢？各大公爵会将目光对准谁？是更多被波及的无辜萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或许是一支带着众多萨卡兹在维多利亚游荡的激进感染者队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放任他们回去只会更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，陈，最后我们面对公爵联军插翅难飞的时候，你又要如何保下在那里的感染者与无辜的萨卡兹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行刑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！此事还有斡旋的余地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈的剑锋抵向九的喉咙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我设想过很多次这个场面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为，这会来得更早些，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的上级很多都是我的同学，我可以去见见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以什么身份？龙门近卫局的前高级警司？还是罗德岛的干员陈？还是如你所说......只是老同学叙叙旧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少我可以保证你们还有这些萨卡兹不会出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我相信你能兑现你的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你并没有理解我的意思，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人的力量终有极限，哪怕是你，也无法保护到自己视线以外的其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是因为我太了解你的能力......我才更加确定你一时的善意没有办法改变任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要的是愿意跟随我们的人自己去看，我们需要做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这套诡辩对我没用，九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看到了客观的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“诡辩”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我们都追求所谓的“公平”，但你我所认可的公平亦有差异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈......所以我早已放弃奢求你能理解我，还有我所期许的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可逮捕我，陈警官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤霄并未有分毫的移动，九也并未挪开直视陈的目光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而一柄燃着烈焰的剑荡开了赤霄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不是留给你们叙旧的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini02_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，塔露拉将长剑狠狠插入地板，隔开了针锋相对的两人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可没叫你出手，塔露拉，别擅作主张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"九，晖洁的方案并无不妥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"各大公爵只会庆幸有人自愿将伦蒂尼姆城内的萨卡兹都带走，不一定会对我们出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，那些人还看着你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只关心，现在，他们该去哪里？"},{"type":"narration","text":"被救下的萨卡兹，跟随九一起行动的整合运动成员，他们害怕，他们不知所措。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"九，他们中的很多人，还做不到理解你所要的东西。他们只想活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他们需要时间。向他们展示你所看到的未来，也许需要很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有足够的耐心，让那些口号变成我们实际行动的纲领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用更多的牺牲来做到吗？谁应当被牺牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我无意去评判你们的对错，也轮不到我来说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，带他们走，带上所有还愿意和我们一起离开的人走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕晖洁真能做到让维多利亚人暂时不会纠缠我们，也必须做好最坏的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在命令我吗，塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我在发表我的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是你们能去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们的身份都太过敏感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你会说把我们都带回罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会的，我必须见证对你们的审判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但不是现在。如今还有许多感染者仰仗着你们的保护，我不能将他们弃之不顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......真是经典的回答，陈警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"想听听我的想法吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉鲜有在九面前表露自己态度的时候，甚至她的过于配合也时常让九对她有很多的怀疑。\n但塔露拉从未掉队。\n她永远沉默地走在队伍的中央，不起眼到时常让人忽视她的存在。\n整合运动的领袖，科西切的养女，切尔诺伯格灾难的幕后操手。\n塔露拉，那个被不了解真相的感染者奉为英雄的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini02_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的剑开始灼烧，火焰在地板上蔓延，蹿起又落下，勾勒出一个标志的轮廓。\n三人眼中映着火光，但面色却有些阴沉，那标志曾代表一段黑暗的过往。\n种种罪行与荒唐皆被深藏其中，揭开便会刺痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以回乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是个好主意，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你还想着自己那未竟的事业吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是去纠正我自己犯下的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"从乌萨斯来的人带来了一些消息，在冻原上，重新又聚集起了打破镣铐的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他们自称受到整合运动的号召，决定站出来为感染者与受到压迫的所有人争取该有的权利与自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他们被一个不知从何而起的虚假谎言鼓舞，但反抗的决心却无比真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们给了你一些重提旧事的勇气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那里不是只有感染者，还有青年学生、被流放的军官与士兵、身怀负罪感的贵族子弟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这正是你们需要的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"抛弃了种族间的隔阂、身份的参差与对疾病的恐惧，一股为同一个目标而团结的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，带着这么多人离开会花上些时间......我想这足够你将Guard留下的宝贵看法解释给还愿意追随你的人听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你并不想重新恢复整合运动的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我只是未曾料到，时至今日它留下的影响仍会如此大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕乌萨斯帝国早已将切尔诺伯格发生的一切都封存起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"渴望反抗的声音就像水一样，或许它们会被灼干，但总会随着雨水重新落回大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回到乌萨斯，这不是能轻易做出的抉择。这牵涉太多，我需要确认更多的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陈，那是你的事，不是我们需要考虑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使整合运动需要焕然一新，重新成为那个象征着自由与幸福的组织。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢，塔露拉......你的罪孽无法洗清，你的存在即是整合运动最黑暗的曾经。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样的你，又如何再去面对那片纯白的雪原？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我知晓如今自己在这里的身份早已不是领导者，而是一个符号，一面旗帜，甚至......是一把被握在手中的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但我接受，我接受你们加在我身上的枷锁。我有过许多身份，德拉克、贵族、领袖、感染者......但它们已不再重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我唯一的身份是播撒过罪孽的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那些我在乌萨斯犯下的罪行，请让我在乌萨斯偿还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偿还......你说得何其容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不是单单作为一面旗帜去偿还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那又是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"投身于真正的火焰，任其灼烧，直至融化那片冷酷的雪原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini02_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回到乌萨斯......去面对真正属于我的审判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"九，你可以见证这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"见证整合运动的结束，自它尸体中诞生的新事物，才是你真正想要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真不在意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我心中的整合运动早已消寂在那片雪原之上......随着我的小队、我的同伴一同远去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和你们一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕我还会伤害无辜之人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不止你，还有九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间跟着整合运动活动以来，我可以确认这支队伍已经发生了某些变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是好是坏......我说不准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想错过你的审判，也不想就这么武断地认定九所坚持的道路就是正确的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我仅以罗德岛的干员陈的身份监视你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管去乌萨斯会发生什么，我都需要保证给罗德岛一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，九，你们都是我的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......随你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你们现在最好马上就开始撤离，这些士兵交给我，我在保证他们无恙后追上你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们可没有说会等你，陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道我找上你们之前，你们有等过我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那便到乌萨斯去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"到乌萨斯去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剑锋处的火焰依旧缓缓蔓延开来。\n炙热的焰舌舔舐着墙角堆积的尸体，轻轻将他们包裹。\n在轻微的哔剥声中，塔露拉默默祈祷这些人能被火焰带去一个更为温暖与明亮的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动战士"]}]}
